		"content": "## Mr. Jonathan F. Tse, MBA (Faculty & IT Certification Reviewer)\n- **Position / Title**: College Faculty / IT Certification Reviewer; Businessman (Properties of Evergreen General Merchandise).\n- **Undergraduate Degree**: BS Computer Engineering — University of San Carlos (USC), graduated Magna Cum Laude.\n- **Post-Graduate Degree**: Master of Business Administration (MBA) — Ateneo Graduate School of Business.\n- **Industry & Corporate Background**: Nearly 20 years in software development leadership with a Japanese technology company, culminating as Vice President for Cebu Operations.\n- **Community & Institutional Leadership**: President of SJC Alumni Foundation (served 3 years); Chief of Staff of Rotary International District 3860.\n- **Outstanding Achievement**: PhilNITS IT Passport Exam — Scored highest among 1,612 examinees across all 6 IT PEC countries.\n- **Subjects Handled**: IT Certification Exam Review (PhilNITS & IT certifications)."
